{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"3c21044a67613c38d8a30eaef3d117bd04be1afc021705fa69f62953becedb9c","digest":{"component_or_area":"eval-spec validation and CI gating","key_entities":["tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py","validate_eval_spec()","src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml",".github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml",".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","_build-and-test.yml","strict=True","gold_set","dataset"],"problem_keywords":["eval-spec validation","strict discipline","unit test","gating","gold_set","dataset","CI workflow"],"propositions":["Strict eval-spec validation currently runs only in a non-gating standalone GitHub Actions workflow (prompt-eval.yml), not in the default pytest suite that gates Verified votes via gerrit-verify.yaml.","Specs with dataset but missing gold_set have shipped merged (Verified +1) because the validation does not block the verify gate, only reddens the offline workflow after merge.","A glob-based unit test must be added to tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py to validate every packaged eval spec and enforce strict validation for dataset-bearing specs, making it part of the default test suite that gates the Verified vote.","The redundant inline validation step must be removed from .github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml once the unit test covers the same discipline."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787874637066896001,"uuid":"a22b5aa3-b0a6-484f-9b4b-acb812fb6952"}